      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَخُمَ</span></b> , (TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَخْمٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَخَمٌ</span> and
